  ==================================================                            
  3. AI ARCHITECTURE                                                            
  ==================================================                            
                                                                                
  The final application will support BOTH:                                      
                                                                                
  1. Live Claude AI                                                             
  2. Mock AI                                                                    
                                                                                
  The application should automatically select the provider.                     
                                                                                
  Configuration:                                                                
                                                                                
  AI_PROVIDER=auto                                                              
                                                                                
  If ANTHROPIC_API_KEY exists:                                                  
      use Claude                                                                
                                                                                
  If ANTHROPIC_API_KEY does not exist:                                          
      use Mock AI                                                               
                                                                                
  If Claude is configured but an API request fails:                             
      gracefully fall back to Mock AI where appropriate.                        
                                                                                
  Both providers must eventually return the same structured response format.    
                                                                                
  Future AI operations:                                                         
                                                                                
  generateSurvey()                                                              
  reviewSurvey()                                                                
  refineSurvey()                                                                
  applyFix()                                                                    
  generateLogic()                                                               
                                                                                
  Today, only prepare the architecture.                                         
                                                                                
  Do NOT implement the actual AI features yet.                                  
                                                                                
