      100 +## AI Architecture                                            
      101 +                                                              
      102 +Two interchangeable providers behind one interface (`AIProvide
          +r` in                                                         
      103 +`lib/ai/provider.ts`). Both return **identical structured shap
          +es**, so the UI                                               
