          +ock     |                                                     
      111 +| `claude`      | Force Claude (fails explicitly if no key)   
          +        |                                                     
      112 +| `mock`        | Force Mock                                  
          +        |                                                     
      113 +                                                              
      114 +Graceful degradation: `withFallback()` in `lib/ai/index.ts` re
          +tries on Mock when                                            
      115 +a Claude call fails for an infrastructure reason. It deliberat
          +ely does **not**                                              
      116 +fall back on `invalid_request` or `not_implemented` — those fa
          +il identically on                                             
      117 +both providers, and substituting mock data there would hide th
          +e real bug. Route                                             
      118 +operations through `withFallback()` so degradation is consiste
          +nt app-wide.                                                  
