       65 +## AI Architecture                                            
       66 +                                                              
       67 +The frontend never calls Claude directly. All AI access is ser
          +ver-side:                                                     
       68 +                                                              
       69 +```                                                           
       70 +Browser                                                       
       71 +  ↓                                                           
       72 +Next.js                                                       
       73 +  ↓                                                           
       74 +Server-side API route                                         
       75 +  ↓                                                           
       76 +AI Provider                                                   
       77 +  ↓                                                           
       78 +Claude OR Mock                                                
       79 +  ↓                                                           
       80 +Structured JSON                                               
       81 +  ↓                                                           
       82 +React Survey State                                            
       83 +```                                                           
       84 +                                                              
       85 +Provider code lives in [lib/ai/](lib/ai/) and is **server-only
          +**. Shared                                                    
       86 +contracts live in [types/ai.ts](types/ai.ts) and [types/survey
          +.ts](types/survey.ts).                                        
       87 +                                                              
       88 +Planned operations: `generateSurvey()`, `reviewSurvey()`, `ref
          +ineSurvey()`,                                                 
       89 +`applyFix()`, `generateLogic()`.                              
       90 +                                                              
       91 +### Claude / Mock Strategy                                    
       92 +                                                              
       93 +Two interchangeable providers sit behind a single `AIProvider`
          + interface and                                                
       94 +return **identical structured shapes**, so the UI never branch
          +es on which one                                               
       95 +answered.                                                     
       96 +                                                              
       97 +| `AI_PROVIDER` | Behaviour                                   
          +     |                                                        
       98 +| ------------- | --------------------------------------------
          +---- |                                                        
       99 +| `auto`        | Claude if `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` is set, else M
          +ock   |                                                       
      100 +| `claude`      | Force Claude (fails explicitly if no key)   
          +      |                                                       
      101 +| `mock`        | Force Mock                                  
          +      |                                                       
      102 +                                                              
      103 +If Claude is configured but a request fails for an infrastruct
          +ure reason, the                                               
      104 +app gracefully falls back to Mock AI. Bad requests and unimple
          +mented operations                                             
      105 +are *not* masked by fallback, so real problems stay visible.  
      106 +                                                              
      107 +You can check which provider is active at                     
      108 +[`/api/ai/status`](app/api/ai/status/route.ts):               
      109 +                                                              
      110 +```json                                                       
      111 +{ "mode": "auto", "active": "mock", "configured": false }     
      112 +```                                                           
